{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"Expenditure on pensions by type of pension and means-testing","source":"ESTAT","updated":"2026-10-07T23:00:00+0200","value":{"0":9.39,"1":9.09,"2":9.04,"3":8.96,"4":8.93,"5":8.87,"6":8.77,"7":9.02,"8":9.25,"9":10.13,"10":10.58,"11":11.08,"12":11.83,"13":12.57,"14":12.74,"15":12.54,"16":12.52,"17":12.35,"18":12.47,"19":12.63,"20":14.39,"21":13.77,"22":12.98,"23":13.16,"24":13.23},"id":["freq","spdepb","spdepm","unit","geo","time"],"size":[1,1,1,1,1,25],"dimension":{"freq":{"label":"Time frequency","category":{"index":{"A":0},"label":{"A":"Annual"}}},"spdepb":{"label":"Pension type","category":{"index":{"TOTAL":0},"label":{"TOTAL":"Total"}}},"spdepm":{"label":"Means testing","category":{"index":{"TOTAL":0},"label":{"TOTAL":"Total"}}},"unit":{"label":"Unit of measure","category":{"index":{"PC_GDP":0},"label":{"PC_GDP":"Percentage of gross domestic product (GDP)"}}},"geo":{"label":"Geopolitical entity (reporting)","category":{"index":{"ES":0},"label":{"ES":"Spain"}}},"time":{"label":"Time","category":{"index":{"2000":0,"2001":1,"2002":2,"2003":3,"2004":4,"2005":5,"2006":6,"2007":7,"2008":8,"2009":9,"2010":10,"2011":11,"2012":12,"2013":13,"2014":14,"2015":15,"2016":16,"2017":17,"2018":18,"2019":19,"2020":20,"2021":21,"2022":22,"2023":23,"2024":24},"label":{"2000":"2000","2001":"2001","2002":"2002","2003":"2003","2004":"2004","2005":"2005","2006":"2006","2007":"2007","2008":"2008","2009":"2009","2010":"2010","2011":"2011","2012":"2012","2013":"2013","2014":"2014","2015":"2015","2016":"2016","2017":"2017","2018":"2018","2019":"2019","2020":"2020","2021":"2021","2022":"2022","2023":"2023","2024":"2024"}}}},"extension":{"lang":"EN","description":"<p>Expenditure on pensions measures public and, where relevant, private spending on cash pension benefits within social protection systems. Amounts are broken down by type of pension, including old-age, disability, survivors’ and early retirement benefits, and by whether entitlements are means-tested or non means-tested. Values are expressed in monetary units, per inhabitant and as a percentage of Gross Domestic Product (GDP), using harmonized definitions to ensure cross‑country comparability.</p>","id":"SPR_EXP_PENS","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"1.0","datastructure":{"id":"SPR_EXP_PENS","agencyId":"ESTAT","version":"59.0"},"annotation":[{"type":"CREATED","date":"2024-11-07T14:26:52+0100"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML","title":"<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/SPR_EXP_PENS\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/SPR_EXP_PENS</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2023-01-19</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SPR_20241119.pdf","text":"Information note"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SPR_20241119.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK","title":"text-category","href":"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SPR_20241119.pdf"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_OBJECT_TYPE","title":"DATASET"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_TIMESTAMP_DATA","date":"2026-10-07T23:00:00+0200"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_TIMESTAMP_GLOBAL","date":"2026-10-07T23:00:00+0200"},{"type":"DISSEMINATION_TIMESTAMP_PLANNED","date":"2026-10-07T23:00:00+0200"},{"type":"ESMS_HTML","title":"Explanatory texts (metadata)","href":"https: